Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteenth  Episode\NThe Puppet Show\NTink and Colette
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on over, step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man Anzoro is back again this year! It's Old Man Anzoro's puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up! Come on over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man Azoro's puppet show is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so many people have gathered!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Old Anthro's puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Everyone's making a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing gathered over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a puppet show?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.43,0:02:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you asking why everyone's gathered?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Old Man Azoro's puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, let me see too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, here's a greeting from our cute puppet, Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:02:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I'm Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please become my fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing Snow White next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cute little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, "Snow White and the Giant Monster" is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!, she's the cutest thing ever! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! A monster is attacking to eat Snow White!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to Snow White? Will the monster eat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't say that! Show us more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for today! Bring money tomorrow, and I'll show you the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, poor Colette! Please be safe!" So bring money tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll show you the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is Old Man Anzoro's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Colette is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Colette as Snow White!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what monster shows up, you're safe with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If one shows up, I won't let it off easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll punch it, kick it, stomp on it, and ride on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s making such a racket at this hour? How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Who on earth are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Colette?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! You can't see her unless you bring money tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't linger around here! Hurry up and go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Making money sure isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet money, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy right now, so I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I carried ten cups of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the money like you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need money for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To see a puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it! I hate greedy kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo! Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pick on me, I'll set a bulldog on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! I lied about the bulldog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet money, I'll never let you go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, good night, my sweet money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast asleep, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't little Mr. Money! You shouldn't be up this late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, be a good boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Off to sleep you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,D-D-D... Do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti... Thief! Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help! A thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.53,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, made a fortune today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody suspects that beloved Old Man Anzoro is actually a master thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And I raked in a bundle again tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the skill and the brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll earn a fortune while I can, then live peacefully with my puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there, aren't you a cutie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a popular one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll use your white dress to rake in heaps of cash from the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing a puppet show in town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's super fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I wanna see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing "Snow White and the Giant Monster"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet man won't let us watch unless we bring money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to find a way to go see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this really wonderful puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Colette, and she's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for her right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like her, Tink, we still can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who threw that in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it hit Dr. Uranari's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you're taking your mischief a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Doctor, please lend us some money! Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Money, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only waste it, Your Highness, so I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, don't say that! — When I say no, I mean no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find them, they'll be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up, come on over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet show is starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette's 'Snow White and the Giant Monster' is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up! Money, money, money, money! Pay your fee and hurry on inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only one sen, so it's cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I want to see! I want to see! I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're starting with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today, just like every other day,\NPrincess Snow White has come into the woods...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...to gather firewood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, what a wonderful day!\NHello, little bird! How are you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, those raspberries look\Ndelicious! I'll pick some!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a beautiful little pond! I'll wash my face\Nin this clear, cool water!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I show my face, they'll spot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Among the yellow flowers, a hideous monster suddenly appears!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to eat the Princess!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, stay down! You're going to get us caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette! The monster! This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a play, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aaah! Help!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you evil monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey squirt, watching without paying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching for free is the first step toward becoming a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't have any pocket money with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this dagger if you let me watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's covered in diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure! Go right ahead and watch from the front row!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha! Prince Sapphire, I've finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...A prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving away the royal dagger just to watch a puppet show...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, let's return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "no" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be severely punished for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't listen, I'm telling your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"Prince," huh? But wow, what a dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be worth a million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what it's like inside the castle, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me all about the inside of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the grand interior, and the prince's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, how wonderful that would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell me, I'll show you the puppet show for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you want to know about the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I just do, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, and Colette will give you a special kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:12:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that runt, I've got the castle layout figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, the prince's room is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll be rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a nice place, too. Ah, you little runt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a runt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you make Colette steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to give the dagger back to Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! I dropped the dagger we worked so hard to get!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who was stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s making all that noise out there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I won't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going back to Sapphire to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, making Colette do things like stealing is just... well, it's just wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got a thief here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to make amends! My, my, what an unusual thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I just had a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as I say if you don't want your head chopped off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely up to no—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, serves you right! I'm locking you up and never letting you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man Anzoro, you mustn't listen to what Nylon says!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely plotting something bad against Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting on a puppet show at the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely! It's a special event I, Nylon, have arranged for you, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready in the courtyard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The title of the play is "The Tomboy Princess."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be quite a sight to see the looks on Sapphire and the Queen's faces when they watch this play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I stayed up all night coming up with this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once again, our tomboy princess skips her lessons to go play in the forest.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, she's dressed just like a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go save Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon is definitely up to something evil using little Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}En garde!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}En garde!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How beautiful you are!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess Tomboy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you want, Vinyl?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a girl, Princess, so please wear a cute dress.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forgive me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forgive me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look, I'm a boy! Got that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I worry about the Princess so much. Why does she lie and say she's a boy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My heart aches.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, this must be a scheme by Duralumin and Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just act normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess, why are you lying about being a boy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, they keep telling me to become king,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I can just chop off the heads of anyone I don't like! Yah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire isn't that kind of girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not care for this puppet show?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire looks pale, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should call it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen seems to be suffering quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll surely confess Sapphire is a girl any moment now. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally become king!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad people like you will be eaten by the King of Hell, Lord Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma or whatever, I don't care! I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat them all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so sorry for Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Mother, isn't that just a show?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Demon of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that lying tomboy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a real demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One snap and I won't move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppet is moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the real Lord Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anzoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No more evil deeds for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us! We'll never do bad things again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin my play!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Running is useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you all to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to death, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My puppets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Colette, and all my other puppets... will I never see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking of it, my tears overflow like a waterfall,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.57,0:21:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and now everything I see looks like a puppet to me...My beloved dolls! But it has all vanished like bubbles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for my own wickedness has brought this punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,, Colette
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Old Man Anzoro, it's Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right! It's Colette!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, did you catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just soaked because the carriage fell in the river, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Man, did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, very much. Just seeing you in a dream makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I'm no dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:21:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the real Little Red! Ah, you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, pulling me so suddenly... That was mean, Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. I was just so happy. Did you save Colette, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! And all the other puppets, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I've never been so happy in my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything bad anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I definitely—probably—won't ever steal again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove it, I'll put on a puppet show for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.23,0:22:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.85,0:22:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come on out now, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he'll show us even if we don't have money!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up for Old Man Anzoro's puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, it really is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that monster again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, you brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep picking on them and you'll have to deal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Tink! Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, right at the best part! That's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See you all next week!
