Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪\NLet’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪\NEven if devils come, even if storms arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.17,0:24:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪\NOur bonded hearts will never part.
